{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Add the package","anchor":"Add-the-package"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"type":"text","text":". In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"0.8.0\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links a binary framework, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":", which SwiftPM checks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Register-the-wallet","text":"Register the wallet","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s Info.plist ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleURLTypes"},{"type":"text","text":"), and pass the URL the app receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the issuance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificates: ","type":"text"},{"code":"issuerRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"verifierRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because it sent the offer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Provide the keys and the storage","anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key — the one a credential is bound to — signs only when presenting, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by default asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode first: add an"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","type":"heading","anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","type":"reference"},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Create the wallet","type":"heading","anchor":"Create-the-wallet","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middle of leaves its keys behind."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots)","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Ship the release build","type":"heading","anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links the release build of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild"},{"type":"text","text":" says which one an app has,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"}]}]}]}]}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, and create it at launch.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting started"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingToSafari":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, as an iOS document provider.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","title":"Presenting to Safari","role":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingInPerson":{"kind":"article","title":"Presenting in person","abstract":[{"text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson","role":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform’s data protection. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","title":"CredentialStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStore"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStore"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"inAppGroup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Options","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FileCredentialStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","abstract":[{"text":"A store in the app group ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"text":"’s container","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its extensions listing the group in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.security.application-groups"},{"text":" entitlement share.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"kind":"symbol","title":"WalletProvider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletProvider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletProvider"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","abstract":[{"text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere.","type":"text"}],"title":"FileCredentialStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"title":"KeychainKeyStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"type":"topic","title":"Handling errors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helps without personal data."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderAccessGroup":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The Keychain access group holder keys are made in, when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app shares them with an extension — a document provider","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"keychain-access-groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every key is in the default group.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderaccessgroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","title":"holderAccessGroup","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderAccessGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"title":"Wallet","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ReceivingCredentials":{"title":"Receiving credentials","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","abstract":[{"text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and look after them once they’re held.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"type":"topic","title":"platform","abstract":[{"text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message follows.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"platform"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Code","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","title":"network","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"OID4VCWallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GoingToProduction":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction","type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","title":"Going to production","abstract":[{"text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"title":"WalletConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"NewWallet’s configuration."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isTestBuild","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild","title":"isTestBuild","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier ("},{"code":"-tags mobiletest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"): an app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"should refuse to run on it."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingFromALink":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"type":"topic","title":"Presenting from a link","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","kind":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store (the Secure Enclave). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":" WalletError."}],"title":"KeyStore","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"}}}